	Total annual grid upgrading cost[Vallemaggia] + Total annual grid upgrading cost[Leventina\
		] + Total annual grid upgrading cost[Blenio] + Total annual grid upgrading cost[Riviera\
		] + Total annual grid upgrading cost[Locarno] ~~|
