		 ([(0,0)-(10,10)],(0,26900),(5,26900),(10,28300),(20,34700),(70,44000),(100,61100),\
		(200,76000) )) ~~|
Investment cost HS noST[GasST,District,Performance,Type]= WITH LOOKUP (
